# ============================================================
# LAND-TITLE AREA, COUNT AND BLOCK-SIZE SUMMARY BY PHU
#
# Extents analysed for each PHU:
#   1. Total PHU
#   2. DoA peat:
#      Sapi, Klias, Sipitang and Usukan soil associations
#   3. SFD peat:
#      Klias and Sipitang soil associations
#
# Title classes expected:
#   CL, NT, PL, FR, TL and NULL
#
# For every PHU extent and title class, the script reports:
#   - total title-class area clipped to the extent
#   - percentage of the extent
#   - number of unique titles intersecting the extent
#   - mean title size from the original "ha" field
#   - median title size from the original "ha" field
#   - number of titles:
#       below 40.46 ha
#       from 40.46 to 500 ha
#       above 500 ha
#
# Size classes are not calculated for TL.
#
# Geometry handling:
#   - removes missing and empty geometries
#   - removes Z and M dimensions
#   - repairs invalid geometries
#   - extracts polygon components
#   - applies zero-distance buffering in a projected CRS
#   - uses feature-by-feature intersection if bulk clipping fails
# ============================================================


